{"seq":3,"slug":"color-profiles","title":"色彩配置与 ICC","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-color-management/foundations/color-profiles","wordCount":1343,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"色彩配置与-icc\">色彩配置与 ICC</h1><p>一张照片在 Photoshop 里是橙红的夕阳，导出上传后在浏览器里变成灰扑扑的土黄——这种事故的根源几乎总是 ICC 配置（ICC profile）。前两篇讲了色彩空间在数学上如何定义，但还缺一环：现实中每块屏幕、每台相机、每个文件，对&quot;同一组 RGB 数值代表什么光&quot;的理解都不同。<strong>ICC 配置就是把设备相关的数值翻译成设备无关的绝对色彩坐标的换算表</strong>，它是把抽象色彩空间锚定到真实世界的胶水。没有它，颜色就是漂浮的数字；有了它，整条管线才能保证&quot;作者看到的&quot;约等于&quot;用户看到的&quot;。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-profile-是一张翻译表\">核心概念：profile 是一张翻译表</h2><p>ICC（International Color Consortium）在 1990 年代定义了一种标准文件格式 <code>.icc</code>/<code>.icm</code>，描述某个设备或某个抽象空间与 CIEXYZ（或 CIELab）这一绝对参照系之间的双向换算。一个 profile 本质包含两部分：原色/白点（确定三角形位置）和传递曲线（确定 gamma），加上渲染意图等元数据。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[相机/Photoshop&lt;br/&gt;导出图片] --&gt; B[嵌入 ICC profile&lt;br/&gt;如 sRGB IEC61966 / Display P3]&#10;  B --&gt; C[浏览器读取 profile]&#10;  C --&gt; D[数值 → CIEXYZ 绝对坐标]&#10;  D --&gt; E[读取显示器 profile&lt;br/&gt;系统色彩管理]&#10;  E --&gt; F[CIEXYZ → 这块屏的数值]&#10;  F --&gt; G[屏幕发出正确的光]&#10;  H[未嵌入 profile 的图片] --&gt; I[浏览器假定 sRGB]&#10;  I --&gt; D\">flowchart TD\n  A[相机/Photoshop&lt;br/&gt;导出图片] --&gt; B[嵌入 ICC profile&lt;br/&gt;如 sRGB IEC61966 / Display P3]\n  B --&gt; C[浏览器读取 profile]\n  C --&gt; D[数值 → CIEXYZ 绝对坐标]\n  D --&gt; E[读取显示器 profile&lt;br/&gt;系统色彩管理]\n  E --&gt; F[CIEXYZ → 这块屏的数值]\n  F --&gt; G[屏幕发出正确的光]\n  H[未嵌入 profile 的图片] --&gt; I[浏览器假定 sRGB]\n  I --&gt; D</pre><p>链路的精髓是两次翻译：先用图片的 profile 把数值升到绝对坐标，再用显示器的 profile 把绝对坐标降到这块屏的数值。中间的 CIEXYZ 是设备无关的&quot;普通话&quot;，任意源到任意屏都经它中转。</p>\n<h2 id=\"未标记内容-默认-srgb-的铁律\">未标记内容：默认 sRGB 的铁律</h2><p>前端最该记住的一条规则：<strong>浏览器对没有嵌入 ICC profile 的图片和所有 CSS 颜色，一律假定为 sRGB</strong>。这是 W3C 的明确约定，Firefox 自 89 版起也把未标记图片与 CSS 颜色统一按 sRGB 处理，与 Chrome、Safari 行为对齐。</p>\n<p>这条铁律有两个直接推论。其一，如果你的素材其实是 Adobe RGB 或 P3 拍摄但没嵌 profile，浏览器会错当成 sRGB 渲染，颜色就会偏移——所以发布上网的图片务必嵌入正确 profile（最稳妥是转成 sRGB 并嵌入）。其二，CSS 里写的 <code>#hex</code>/<code>rgb()</code> 永远是 sRGB，这也是为什么要用 <code>color(display-p3 ...)</code> 显式越界，回到 <a href=\"gamut-wide-color\">色域与广色域 P3</a> 描述的更大三角形。</p>\n<h2 id=\"profile-版本-v2-与-v4-的坑\">profile 版本：v2 与 v4 的坑</h2><p>ICC profile 有 v2 和 v4 两代格式。经验法则：sRGB 与 Adobe RGB 常用 v2，Display P3 用 v4。所有浏览器都支持 v2，但对 v4 的支持历史上参差不齐——一个只认 v2 的环境遇到嵌了 v4 profile 的图片，可能渲染出非预期颜色。下表整理常见 profile 的定位：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>profile</th>\n<th>版本</th>\n<th>色域</th>\n<th>前端常见来源</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>sRGB IEC61966-2.1</td>\n<td>v2</td>\n<td>sRGB</td>\n<td>网页默认、安全选择</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Display P3</td>\n<td>v4</td>\n<td>P3</td>\n<td>苹果设备截图/导出</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Adobe RGB (1998)</td>\n<td>v2</td>\n<td>介于 sRGB 与 P3</td>\n<td>摄影/印刷素材</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>ProPhoto RGB</td>\n<td>v2</td>\n<td>极宽（超可见色边缘）</td>\n<td>RAW 编辑中间态，不宜直接上网</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>ProPhoto 尤其危险：它的色域大到三个原色有一个落在人眼可见色之外，未经转换直接上网几乎必然色偏，应在导出时转为 sRGB 或 Display P3。</p>\n<h2 id=\"渲染意图-超界颜色的翻译策略\">渲染意图：超界颜色的翻译策略</h2><p>当源 profile 的颜色超出目标屏色域，profile 转换需要一个策略，称为渲染意图（rendering intent）。ICC 定义四种：感知（perceptual，整体压缩保关系，适合照片）、相对比色（relative colorimetric，保住在界内的颜色、裁剪超界的，适合精确色）、绝对比色（含白点适配，用于打样）、饱和度（保鲜艳，用于图表）。Web 场景里浏览器的色彩管理主要走相对比色或感知，前端通常无法显式选择，但理解它能解释&quot;为什么照片转换后整体略平、而纯色块更易跳变&quot;。</p>\n<p>这与 <a href=\"gamut-wide-color\">色域与广色域 P3</a> 里讲的 CSS gamut mapping 是同一类问题的两个层面：渲染意图是 ICC/操作系统层的策略，CSS gamut mapping 是浏览器对 CSS 颜色值的处理，二者最终都在浏览器色彩管线中汇合，详见 <a href=\"../advanced/color-management-pipeline\">浏览器色彩管线</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"色差与转换精度\">色差与转换精度</h2><p>profile 转换的质量可用感知色差 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>E</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta E</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span></span></span></span></span> 衡量。CIE76 定义为 CIELab 空间的欧氏距离：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><msub><mi>E</mi><mn>76</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><msup><mi>L</mi><mo>∗</mo></msup><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><msup><mi>a</mi><mo>∗</mo></msup><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><msup><mi>b</mi><mo>∗</mo></msup><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></msqrt></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta E_{76} = \\sqrt{(\\Delta L^*)^2 + (\\Delta a^*)^2 + (\\Delta b^*)^2}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">76</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.24em;vertical-align:-0.2561em;\"></span><span class=\"mord sqrt\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9839em;\"><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-3.2em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.2em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"padding-left:1em;\"><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6147em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.989em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">∗</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7401em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.989em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6147em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.989em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">∗</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7401em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.989em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6147em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.989em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">∗</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7401em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.989em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.9439em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.2em;\"></span><span class=\"hide-tail\" style=\"min-width:1.02em;height:1.28em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"1.28em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 1296\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin slice\"><path d=\"M263,681c0.7,0,18,39.7,52,119\nc34,79.3,68.167,158.7,102.5,238c34.3,79.3,51.8,119.3,52.5,120\nc340,-704.7,510.7,-1060.3,512,-1067\nl0 -0\nc4.7,-7.3,11,-11,19,-11\nH40000v40H1012.3\ns-271.3,567,-271.3,567c-38.7,80.7,-84,175,-136,283c-52,108,-89.167,185.3,-111.5,232\nc-22.3,46.7,-33.8,70.3,-34.5,71c-4.7,4.7,-12.3,7,-23,7s-12,-1,-12,-1\ns-109,-253,-109,-253c-72.7,-168,-109.3,-252,-110,-252c-10.7,8,-22,16.7,-34,26\nc-22,17.3,-33.3,26,-34,26s-26,-26,-26,-26s76,-59,76,-59s76,-60,76,-60z\nM1001 80h400000v40h-400000z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2561em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>经验上 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>E</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta E &lt; 1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7224em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span> 人眼几乎不可分辨，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>E</mi><mo>≈</mo><mn>2</mn><mtext>–</mtext><mn>3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta E \\approx 2\\text{–}3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">–</span></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span></span></span></span></span> 训练有素者能察觉。后续 CIE94、CIEDE2000 对此做了感知加权修正。前端虽很少手算，但当你需要验证&quot;导出转换后颜色偏了多少&quot;，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>E</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta E</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span></span></span></span></span> 是客观度量——也是对比度、可访问性判断背后共享的色差思想，详见 <a href=\"../practice/accessible-contrast\">可访问对比与 APCA</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>ICC profile 是设备/空间与 CIEXYZ 绝对坐标之间的双向换算表，把抽象空间锚定到真实光。</li>\n<li>色彩管理是两次翻译：源 profile 升到 CIEXYZ，显示器 profile 降到屏幕数值。</li>\n<li>未嵌入 profile 的图片与所有 CSS 颜色，浏览器一律按 sRGB 处理——上网图片务必嵌入正确 profile。</li>\n<li>v2/v4 版本与 ProPhoto 等超宽 profile 是常见色偏来源；上网前转 sRGB 或 Display P3 最稳。</li>\n<li>渲染意图与 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>E</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta E</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span></span></span></span></span> 色差是理解转换策略与转换质量的两个关键量。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>本 hub 内：<a href=\"gamut-wide-color\">色域与广色域 P3</a> 讲 profile 背后色域三角形的几何；<a href=\"../advanced/color-management-pipeline\">浏览器色彩管线</a> 讲浏览器在哪一步应用 profile。</li>\n<li>跨 hub：<a href=\"../../frontend-image-media-optimization/\">前端图像与媒体优化 — 图片格式与编码</a> 涉及导出图片时 profile 嵌入与体积的权衡。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"色彩配置与 ICC","id":"色彩配置与-icc"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：profile 是一张翻译表","id":"核心概念-profile-是一张翻译表"},{"level":2,"text":"未标记内容：默认 sRGB 的铁律","id":"未标记内容-默认-srgb-的铁律"},{"level":2,"text":"profile 版本：v2 与 v4 的坑","id":"profile-版本-v2-与-v4-的坑"},{"level":2,"text":"渲染意图：超界颜色的翻译策略","id":"渲染意图-超界颜色的翻译策略"},{"level":2,"text":"色差与转换精度","id":"色差与转换精度"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"色域与广色域 P3","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-color-management/foundations/gamut-wide-color"},"next":{"title":"CSS Color 4 色彩规范","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-color-management/css-color/css-color-4"}}